WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.433
Purchase orders lists every vendor order, and how much has been received.

00:00:04.885 --> 00:00:09.494
To upload files, pick DTP or GMBH, and click Upload.

00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:15.832
Upload the Vendor PO list first, then the Purchase received file.

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:20.007
Rows the app could not record wait on the Import issues tab.

00:00:20.007 --> 00:00:22.801
Pick the right vendor there, or dismiss them.
